@* Passive status line under the "Live Prozessdatenansicht" title, in the same band the configuration page uses
   for its datapoint meter - see DataPointUsageMeter. *@
@* Nothing to report until a node is picked and values are actually subscribed - a window counting up beside
   "0 values" would only say the view is idle, which the empty grid says already. *@
@if (Service.Session.IsWatching)
{
    <div class="live-session-info">
        @SessionText
    </div>
}
